      "date": "2026-02-11T13:04:56.000Z",
      "title": "RAILTEL: Long Dated Government IT Contracts Will Sustain Overvaluation Risk",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target on RailTel Corporation of India from ₹265.0 to ₹257.5, reflecting slightly softer assumptions on revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E, partly offset by a marginally lower discount rate. What's in the News Letter of Acceptance from Modern Coach Factory, Raebareli, for supply, installation and commissioning of IP based video surveillance systems in LHB coaches, with 3 years warranty and 5 years CAMC, an order estimated at ₹942,354,138 to be executed by January 28, 2034 (client announcement).",
